264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m012-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p013","text":"靈公立十四年，益驕。趙盾驟諫，靈公弗聽。及食熊蹯，胹不熟，殺宰人，持其尸出，趙盾見之。靈公由此懼，欲殺盾。盾素仁愛人，嘗所食桑下餓人反捍救盾，盾以得亡。未出境，而趙穿弒靈公而立襄公弟黑臀，是爲成公。趙盾復反，任國政。君子譏盾「爲正卿，亡不出境，反不討賊」，故太史書曰「趙盾弒其君」。晉景公時而趙盾卒，諡爲宣孟，子朔嗣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"宰人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神祇、馬匹、校勘或未定稱呼保留；不補名字、成員或闕代，故事說詞不作真孤被殺證據。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002264","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0062","start":62,"end":66,"surface":"桑下餓人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神祇、馬匹、校勘或未定稱呼保留；不補名字、成員或闕代，故事說詞不作真孤被殺證據。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043